[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "text": "This must be karma, "
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "text": "Travis Touchdown."
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "text": "Spare me the mystic crap."
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "text": "I came here to fight."
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "text": "Magnificent... "
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "text": "Travis, The Crownless King."
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "text": "I see the rumors were true."
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "text": "I don't know who's talkin' about me."
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "text": "But that nickname's alright."
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "text": "Listen to me,"
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "text": "Your Highness."
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "text": "These rankings mean "
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "text": "nothing to me."
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "text": "Neither does my sect, or the mob."
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "text": "My only true calling was to clash "
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "text": "swords with you."
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "text": "That's why "
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "text": "I joined this contest."
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "text": "I was starving "
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "text": "for a worthy foe."
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "text": "Then you're in luck."
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "text": "Cause I'm as worthy as it gets."
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "text": "And I've got a shit-ton of"
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "text": "anger to work out."
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "text": "That's what I like to hear... "
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "text": "This is it... This is what "
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "text": "I've been praying for."
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "text": "I'm weary of this gilded world-- "
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "text": "all glitter, no soul."
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "text": "Save me from sorrow, "
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "text": "Crownless King."
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "text": "Thy sword and thy wrath "
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "text": "will deliver me!"
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "text": "Uhh, you should go easy "
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "text": "on that crazy punch."
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "text": "How 'bout I just cut "
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "text": "you a new one?"
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "text": "We'll both do as "
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "text": "Divinity commands."
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "text": "Halle-fuckin-lujah!"
  }
]